  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delegation of grant management under The Government&apos;s Action Plan for Nuclear Safety and the Environment 2018-2022 to the Directorate for Nuclear Safety (DSA). Priority is given to activities promoting safe management of nuclear waste, training of relevant staff and improving safety measures within monitoring, testing and cyber.</narrative>
